{{list:Cyrillic script letters/ru}}

===Etymology 2===
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*sъ(n)}}, see there for more.

====Alternative forms====
* {{alter|ru|съ||ru-PRO}}
* {{l|ru|со}} {{q|before words beginning with certain awkward consonant clusters such as {{m|ru||мн}}, {{m|ru||вс}}, and {{m|ru||сн}}}}

====Pronunciation====
* {{ru-IPA|с}} {{q|before vowels, voiceless consonants, voiced consonants that do not have a voiceless pair, and {{m|ru||в}}}}
** {{ru-IPA|сь}} {{q|before aforementioned consonants if palatalised}}
** {{ru-IPA|ш/}} {{q|possible allophone before {{m|ru||ш}}}}
** {{ru-IPA|щ/}} {{q|possible allophone resulting from merger with the following {{m|ru||ч}} or {{m|ru||щ}}}}
* {{ru-IPA|з/}} {{q|before the voiced consonants {{m|ru||б}}, {{m|ru||г}}, {{m|ru||д}}, {{m|ru||з}} and {{m|ru||ж}}}}
** {{ru-IPA|зь/}} {{q|before aforementioned consonants if palatalised}}
** {{ru-IPA|ж/}} {{q|possible allophone before {{m|ru||ж}}}}
* {{ru-IPA|сə}} {{q|when pausing to think}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-с.ogg}}

====Preposition====
{{head|ru|preposition}}

# {{+obj|ru|ins|catpos=prep}}
## [[with]]
##: {{uxi|ru|'''с''' ([[мой|мои́м]]) [[брат|бра́том]]|'''with''' (my) brother}}
##: {{uxi|ru|'''с''' ([[мой|мое́й]]) [[сестра|сестро́й]]|'''with''' (my) sister}}
##: {{uxi|ru|'''со''' [[весь|все́ми]]|'''with''' everybody}}
##: {{uxi|ru|'''со''' [[я|мной]]|'''with''' me}}
##: {{uxi|ru|'''с''' [[ты|тобо́й]]|'''with''' you}}
## [[with]] {{q|in certain time expressions}}
##: {{uxi|ru|'''с''' [[каждый|ка́ждым]] [[год|го́дом]]|from year to year, year by year, year after year|lit='''with''' each year}}
# {{+obj|ru|gen|catpos=prep}}
## [[from]], [[off]], [[from]] [[off]], [[from]] [[below]] {{q|with abstract nouns; nouns entailing a flat, open area; and special exceptions}}
##: {{uxi|ru|'''с''' [[почта|по́чты]]|'''from''' the post office}}
##: {{uxi|ru|'''с''' [[поле|по́ля]]|'''from''' the field}}
##: {{uxi|ru|'''с''' [[работа|рабо́ты]]|'''from''' work}}
##: {{uxi|ru|'''со''' [[стол|стола́]]|'''off''' the table}}
##: {{uxi|ru|[[сдёрнуть]] [[ска́терть]] '''со''' [[стол|стола́]]|to pull the cloth '''off''' the table}}
##: {{uxi|ru|'''с''' [[начало|нача́ла]] [[до]] [[конец|конца́]]|'''from''' beginning to end}}
## [[because of]], [[since]] {{q|expressing a cause of motivation}}
##: {{uxi|ru|'''с''' [[испуг|испу́га]]|'''due to''' being frightened}}
## [[from]] {{q|indicating a duration of time}} {{+obj|ru|:по(acc)/:до(gen)<to an ending time>}}
##: {{ux|ru|[[ремонт|Ремо́нт]] [[главный|гла́вного]] [[здание|зда́ния]] [[быть|бу́дет]] [[проводи́ться]] '''с''' [[два́дцать]] [[пятый|пя́того]] [[январь|января́]] [[по]] [[седьмой|седьмо́е]] [[февраль|февраля́]]|The renovation of the main building will be conducted '''from''' January 25th to February 7th.}}
##: {{uxi|ru|'''с''' [[три|трёх]] [[год|лет]]|t='''from''' the age of three / '''since''' one was three}}
# {{+obj|ru|acc|catpos=prep}}
## [[for]], [[about]] {{q|indicating approximate time or number}}
##: {{uxi|ru|[[там|Там]] [[быть|бы́ло]] [[груза|гру́за]] [[весом|ве́сом]] '''с''' [[тонна|то́нну]].|There was a load weighing about a ton.}}
##: {{uxi|ru|[[Мальчик-с-пальчик|Ма́льчик-'''с'''-па́льчик]]|Tom Thumb}}
##: {{uxi|ru|'''С''' [[гулькин|гу́лькин]] [[носик|но́сик]]|A little bit}}

=====Usage notes=====
* A noun phrase with the preposition {{m|ru|с}} or {{m|ru|со}} and an abstract noun declined with the {{glossary|instrumental}} case can show adverb-like qualities. The most notable ones are below:
** {{l|ru|с внима́нием|t=with attention/care}}
** {{l|ru|с трудо́м|t=with difficulty}}
** {{l|ru|со скри́пом|t=with difficulty, reluctantly}}
** {{l|ru|с удово́льствием|t=with pleasure}}
** {{l|ru|совсе́м|t=totally}}
* Also with the instrumental case, often used as a standalone prepositional phrase meaning "Happy ...!" or "Congratulations on ...!".  The verb {{m|ru|поздравля́ть}} is implied.
** {{l|ru|с днём рождения|t=happy birthday}}

